OL,3,GNEWSABarn fire prompts warning to shut
OL,4,Awindows and doors
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have been tackling a fire
OL,7,Fin a large barn overnight.
OL,9,FCrews were called on Sunday night after
OL,10,Fthe fire broke out in the Chalgrove
OL,11,Farea of south Oxfordshire.
OL,13,FOxfordshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,14,Fsaid the fire caused a large smoke
OL,15,Fplume to drift north-west in the
OL,16,Fdirection of Little Milton about three
OL,17,Fmiles (5km) away.
OL,19,FThose living in the area have been
OL,20,Fadvised to keep windows and doors
OL,21,Fclosed. The BBC has asked the fire
OL,22,Fservice for further details.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
